WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.560
going to be honest enough to tell you that I'm worried about America. I'm worried about

00:06.560 --> 00:19.520
our nation because it's sick with racism still. Just think about the fact that we live

00:19.520 --> 00:27.360
in a nation which was founded on the principle that all men are created equal. And yet men

00:27.360 --> 00:35.040
are still arguing over whether the color of a man's skin determines the content of his character.

00:35.040 --> 00:44.240
And I believe that the Lord told me to say to the United States of America that it's sick with

00:44.240 --> 00:54.720
militarism and it's sick with excessive materialism. Have you ever thought about it? They are

00:54.720 --> 01:04.720
between 38 and 50 million people in the United States of America who are poverty-stricken,

01:07.120 --> 01:15.200
making income less than the poverty level. And yet this is the richest nation in the history of

01:15.200 --> 01:21.440
the world. Our national growth product this year will go beyond 800 billion dollars.

01:23.200 --> 01:32.480
And yet there between 38 and 50 million people who are poverty-stricken, and I'm wrong. A lot of

01:32.480 --> 01:41.120
people are afraid to say it. But I don't mind saying that you see somebody said to me last night,

01:41.120 --> 01:46.960
don't you think Dr. King, you are going to have to start speaking more in terms of the administration's

01:46.960 --> 01:53.600
policy because since you started talking against a Warren Vietnam, it's hurt the budget of your

01:53.600 --> 01:58.880
organization and people who once respected you don't respect you anymore. And I had to look over

01:59.600 --> 02:09.760
and say, so I'm sorry, but you don't know me. I'm not a consensus leader. I don't determine what

02:09.760 --> 02:14.880
is right and wrong by looking at the budget of my organization. And I don't determine what is

02:14.880 --> 02:22.240
right and wrong by taking a gallop hole of the majority opinion. And so because there's something wrong,

02:23.920 --> 02:33.760
our struggle must continue. And what we must see is that our nation's summers of riots

02:33.760 --> 02:39.040
are caused by our nation's winters of delay.

